{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SEVEN</strong> is a single-player autobattler roguelike strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own deck and advance strategically, taking into account stage-specific relics and enemy units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the weight of every choice in each battle \u2014 your decisions shape your strategy and determine the outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the world\u2019s birth, every race has been born with two hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of sin, the other of virtue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divided by these twin hearts, the races have hated one another and waged endless war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of years passed, yet the war did not stop, and sin took ever deeper root.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you are born to end this fight in the name of virtue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer sin, topple it, and finally eradicate the last corruption left in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must not stop until this battle is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until this fight is over, you cannot stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806030/extras/7add4410e2fd4d33481ee2bdbf23b82b.avif?t=1770899087\" width=920 height=430 /></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Opening the Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806030/0b7670600426819d8b830d116a14525465d78938.jpg"},{"name":"First Setback","path":"https://cdn.akamai